@lang en
IMPORT `pc-travel-claims`

-- Pacific Cross Vietnam, Travel Insurance Policy, INSURING SECTIONS, Part I: MEDICAL EXPENSES
-- AND EMERGENCY ASSISTANCE — section 1A (English src:251-312, Vietnamese src:1349-1409)
-- and section 1B (English src:314-420, Vietnamese src:1411-1517).
--
-- Where the two texts differ in an answer (1B.4 the Hospital Cash Allowance; 1B.7 Return of
-- Children; 1B.9 Referral Services; the Eligible Expenses cap) the rule exists twice.

§ `Insuring sections`
-- src:246 | INSURING SECTIONS:
-- src:1348 | CÁC MỤC BẢO HIỂM

§ `I. Medical expenses and emergency assistance`
-- src:251 | I. MEDICAL EXPENSES AND EMERGENCY ASSISTANCE
-- src:1349 | I. CHI PHÍ Y TẾ VÀ TRỢ GIÚP KHẨN CẤP

§§ `A Disability the Policy covers`

-- Clause 5.1 excludes "Pre-existing Illness or Injury", a phrase the wording does not
-- define; it is read through the definition of Pre-Existing Condition (fork F-PEC). So a
-- Disability whose history meets that definition counts as arising from clause 5.1.
GIVEN d IS A `The Disability`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
`the circumstances the Disability arose from` d MEANS
    IF   `the condition is a Pre-Existing Condition` (d's `history`)
    THEN `a Pre-existing Illness or Injury` FOLLOWED BY d's `arose from`
    ELSE d's `arose from`

-- "a covered Disability contracted or sustained outside the Country of Origin or Country of
-- Residence during the Period of Insurance": the general terms, the cover window on the date
-- it was contracted, and the definition of Disability (an Injury here by its limb (ii)).
GIVEN v IS A `Text version`
      c IS A `The case`
      s IS A `Section`
      d IS A `The Disability`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Disability is covered under section` v c s d IF
        `the general terms let a claim proceed` v c s (d's `date contracted or sustained`) (`the circumstances the Disability arose from` d)
    AND `clause 13 — the cover for the trip is in force on` c (d's `date contracted or sustained`)
    AND d's `contracted or sustained outside the Country of Origin`
    AND `the definition of Disability is met` (d's `facts`) FALSE

§ `Section 1A — Medical Expenses`
-- src:253 | SECTION 1A: TERMS AND CONDITIONS APPLYING TO
-- src:254 | “MEDICAL EXPENSES” BENEFIT (if applicable as per Schedule
-- src:255 | of Benefit)
-- src:1351 | MỤC 1A: CÁC ĐIỀU KHOẢN VÀ ĐIỀU KIỆN ÁP DỤNG CHO
-- src:1352 | QUYỀN LỢI “CHI PHÍ Y TẾ” (căn cứ vào Bảng liệt kê quyền lợi)

§§ `1A.1 — the expenses covered`
-- src:256 | 1. The Company agrees to provide reimbursement of eligible
-- src:257 | inpatient & outpatient expenditure for medical treatment
-- src:258 | arising from a covered Disability contracted or sustained
-- src:259 | outside the Country of Origin or Country of Residence during
-- src:260 | the Period of Insurance and shall include only the following
-- src:261 | expenses:
-- src:1353 | 1. Công ty đồng ý thanh toán các chi phí điều trị y tế nội trú &
-- src:1359 | ngoại trú hợp lệ cho Bệnh tật được bảo hiểm xảy ra ngoài Nước
-- src:1360 | xuất phát hoặc Nước cư trú trong Thời gian bảo hiểm và sẽ chỉ
-- src:1361 | bao gồm những chi phí dưới đây:
-- (a)
-- src:263 | a. Hospitalization, surgery, ambulance and paramedic
-- src:264 | services, diagnostic tests, consultation by registered
-- src:265 | doctors and medicines prescribed; hospital room and board
-- src:266 | which is limited to VND 6,000,000 per day if the hospital
-- src:267 | expense is on per diem basis, a daily reimbursement of all
-- src:268 | the charges inclusive of room and board and professional
-- src:269 | services is limited to VND 20,000,000 if no detailed
-- src:270 | breakdown of charges is provided;
-- src:1362 | a. Viện phí, phí phẫu thuật, các dịch vụ xe cấp cứu và nhân
-- src:1363 | viên y tế cấp cứu đi theo xe, phí xét nghiệm chẩn đoán,
-- src:1364 | phí tư vấn khám chữa bệnh của các bác sĩ có đăng ký hành
-- src:1365 | nghề và thuốc được kê đơn; tiền phòng và ăn uống tối đa
-- src:1366 | là 6.000.000 VND mỗi ngày nếu viện phí được tính trên cơ
-- src:1367 | sở mỗi ngày, nếu các chi phí không được liệt kê một cách
-- src:1368 | chi tiết thì việc thanh toán cho tất cả các chi phí bao gồm
-- src:1369 | cả tiền phòng và ăn uống và các dịch vụ chuyên môn được
-- src:1370 | giới hạn tối đa là 20.000.000 VND một ngày;
-- (b)
-- src:271 | b. Not more than VND 130,000,000 for eligible medical
-- src:272 | expenses defined in paragraph (1a) above arising
-- src:273 | immediately following discharge from hospital within
-- src:274 | 90 days of return to the Country of Origin/Country of
-- src:275 | Residence.
-- src:1371 | b. Chi phí y tế hợp lệ được định nghĩa trong phần (1a) ở trên
-- src:1372 | phát sinh ngay sau khi xuất viện, trong vòng 90 ngày kể từ
-- src:1373 | khi trở về Nước xuất phát/Nước cư trú sẽ không vượt quá
-- src:1374 | 130.000.000 VND.
-- The proviso
-- src:277 | Provided that all such expenditures shall be normal, customary
-- src:278 | and reasonably in nature; be supported by a detailed breakdown
-- src:279 | of charges, original receipts and medical reports with full diagnosis
-- src:280 | provided by a Physician; and with the exception of paragraph (1b)
-- src:281 | above be incurred outside the Country of Origin or Country of
-- src:282 | Residence.
-- src:1375 | Với điều kiện là tất cả các chi phí đó phải là bình thường và hợp
-- src:1377 | lý theo thông lệ và có kèm theo các hoá đơn liệt kê chi tiết các chi
-- src:1378 | phí, các biên nhận gốc và các báo cáo y khoa với các chẩn đoán
-- src:1379 | đầy đủ của Bác sĩ, và phải phát sinh ở bên ngoài Nước xuất phát
-- src:1380 | hoặc Nước cư trú trừ chi phí nêu trong phần (1b) ở trên.
--
-- "shall include only the following expenses": an expense of a kind (a) does not name is
-- not covered. Cosmetic surgery is surgery, which (a) names; eyeglasses, hearing aids and
-- routine check-ups are not named, so the exceptions 1A.2(c) and (h) make for them never pay
-- (finding F-MED-CLOSED; fork F-CHECKUP records the reading that an incidental check-up is a
-- diagnostic test). The proviso requires every expense to "be supported by a detailed breakdown
-- of charges", while (a) caps at VND 20,000,000 a day the charges for which "no detailed
-- breakdown of charges is provided". Read together, the 20,000,000 cap can never be reached
-- (finding F-MED-BREAKDOWN; the test `the no-breakdown cap is unreachable` shows it).

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of medical expense`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `1A.1(a) names the kind of expense` k IF
        k EQUALS `hospitalization`
    OR  k EQUALS `surgery`
    OR  k EQUALS `cosmetic surgery`
    OR  k EQUALS `ambulance and paramedic services`
    OR  k EQUALS `diagnostic tests`
    OR  k EQUALS `consultation by registered doctors`
    OR  k EQUALS `medicines prescribed`
    OR  k EQUALS `hospital room and board, charged on a per diem basis`
    OR  k EQUALS `all charges for a day in hospital, inclusive of room and board and professional services`

-- The daily caps in (a); an expense of either capped kind is one day's charges.
GIVEN x IS A `A medical expense`
      `the eligible amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1A.1(a) — the daily cap applied to` x `of` `the eligible amount` MEANS
    BRANCH IF x's `kind` EQUALS `hospital room and board, charged on a per diem basis`
                THEN min `the eligible amount` 6_000_000
           IF     x's `kind` EQUALS `all charges for a day in hospital, inclusive of room and board and professional services`
              AND NOT x's `a detailed breakdown of charges provided`
                THEN min `the eligible amount` 20_000_000
           OTHERWISE `the eligible amount`

GIVEN c IS A `The case`
      x IS A `A medical expense`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `1A.1(b) — the expense is a follow-up within 90 days of return` c x IF
        x's `arising immediately following discharge from hospital after return to the Country of Origin`
    AND `within 90 days of return` (c's `trip`'s `date of return to the Country of Origin`)
    WHERE
        `within 90 days of return` r MEANS
            CONSIDER r
            WHEN NOTHING        THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST returned  THEN     x's `date incurred` AT LEAST returned
                                     AND x's `date incurred` AT MOST (returned PLUS 90)

GIVEN c IS A `The case`
      x IS A `A medical expense`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `1A.1 proviso — the expense meets the proviso` c x IF
        x's `normal, customary and reasonable`
    AND x's `a detailed breakdown of charges provided`
    AND x's `supported by original receipts and medical reports with full diagnosis by a Physician`
    AND (    x's `incurred outside the Country of Origin`
         OR  `1A.1(b) — the expense is a follow-up within 90 days of return` c x)

§§ `1A.2 — what Medical Expenses does not cover`
-- src:283 | 2. This “Medical Expenses” benefit does not cover:
-- src:1381 | 2. Quyền lợi “Chi phí y tế” này không chi trả cho:
-- (a)
-- src:285 | a. Charges in respect of special or private nursing;
-- src:1382 | a. Các chi phí y tá điều dưỡng đặc biệt hay y tá điều dưỡng
-- src:1383 | riêng;
-- (b)
-- src:286 | b. Physiotherapy, chiropractic and acupuncture;
-- src:1384 | b. Chi phí vật lý trị liệu, nắn xương, châm cứu;
-- (c)
-- src:287 | c. Cosmetic surgery, eyeglasses or hearing aids, and
-- src:288 | prescriptions therefore except as necessitated to correct
-- src:289 | a condition resulting solely from an external accidental
-- src:290 | Injury occurring during the Period of Insurance;
-- src:1385 | c. Phẫu thuật thẩm mỹ, mắt kính hay máy trợ thính, và các
-- src:1386 | đơn thuốc cho việc đó, trừ trường hợp cần thiết phải hiệu
-- src:1387 | chỉnh một tình trạng chỉ do Thương tích do tai nạn từ bên
-- src:1388 | ngoài xảy ra trong Thời gian bảo hiểm;
-- (d)
-- src:291 | d. Medical expenses, which are payable by any other
-- src:292 | insurance or for which a third party may be liable, and
-- src:293 | to the extent that the Company may pay such expenses
-- src:294 | the Insured Person agrees to assist the Company in the
-- src:295 | recovery of such expenses;
-- src:1389 | d. Các chi phí y tế được trả bởi bất kỳ một bảo hiểm nào khác
-- src:1390 | hay do một bên thứ ba có trách nhiệm chi trả, và nếu Công
-- src:1391 | ty trả các chi phí đó thì Người được bảo hiểm đồng ý giúp
-- src:1392 | đỡ Công ty trong việc thu hồi các chi phí đó từ bên thứ ba;
-- (e)
-- src:296 | e. Psychiatric, psychological, mental or nervous disorders
-- src:297 | and insanity;
-- src:1393 | e. Các rối loạn về tâm thần, tâm lý, tinh thần hoặc thần kinh
-- src:1394 | và mất trí;
-- (f)
-- src:298 | f. Any expenses arising from surgical, mechanical or
-- src:299 | chemical methods of birth control or treatments pertaining
-- src:300 | to infertility;
-- src:1395 | f. Bất kỳ chi phí nào phát sinh từ các phương pháp kế hoạch
-- src:1396 | hóa sinh đẻ bằng phẫu thuật, cơ học hay hoá học hoặc các
-- src:1397 | điều trị cho chứng vô sinh;
-- (g)
-- src:301 | g. Any expenses arising from Illness or Injury related to
-- src:302 | pregnancy;
-- src:1398 | g. Bất kỳ chi phí nào phát sinh do Ốm đau hoặc Thương tích
-- src:1399 | có liên quan đến thai sản;
-- (h)
-- src:303 | h. Treatment or services undertaken without the
-- src:304 | recommendation of a Physician; routine physical
-- src:305 | examinations or health check-ups not incidental to the
-- src:306 | treatment or diagnosis of a covered Disability;
-- src:1400 | h. Điều trị hoặc sử dụng dịch vụ mà không có sự chỉ định của
-- src:1401 | Bác sĩ, khám sức khỏe thường lệ hay khám sức khỏe tổng
-- src:1402 | quát không liên quan đến việc điều trị hay chẩn đoán một
-- src:1403 | Bệnh tật được bảo hiểm;
-- (i)
-- src:307 | i. Any medical expenses arising 30 days after the termination
-- src:308 | of this Policy or after the expiry of the coverage of the trip
-- src:309 | (applicable to Annual Travel) in the event the Insured
-- src:310 | Person is unable to return to the Country of Origin/
-- src:311 | Country of Residence, or final destination if different from
-- src:312 | the point of origin.
-- src:1404 | i. Các chi phí y tế phát sinh sau 30 ngày kể từ ngày kết thúc
-- src:1405 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này hoặc kể từ ngày hết hạn bảo hiểm
-- src:1406 | của chuyến đi (áp dụng đối với bảo hiểm du lịch Annual
-- src:1407 | Travel) trong trường hợp Người được bảo hiểm không thể
-- src:1408 | quay trở về Nước xuất phát/Nước cư trú hoặc nơi đến cuối
-- src:1409 | cùng nếu khác với nơi xuất phát.
GIVEN claim IS A `A Medical Expenses claim`
      x     IS A `A medical expense`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `1A.2 — the expense is excluded` claim x IF
        "(a)" ... x's `kind` EQUALS `special or private nursing`
    OR  "(b)" ... x's `kind` EQUALS `physiotherapy, chiropractic or acupuncture`
    OR  "(c)" ... `cosmetic, not to correct an accidental Injury`
    OR  "(d)" ... x's `payable by any other insurance, or a third party may be liable for it`
    OR  "(e)" ... claim's `the Disability`'s `a psychiatric, psychological, mental or nervous disorder, or insanity`
    OR  "(f)" ... x's `kind` EQUALS `birth control by surgical, mechanical or chemical methods, or infertility treatment`
    OR  "(g)" ... claim's `the Disability`'s `related to pregnancy`
    OR  "(h)" ... `without a Physician's recommendation, or a routine check-up`
    WHERE
        `cosmetic, not to correct an accidental Injury` MEANS
                (x's `kind` EQUALS `cosmetic surgery` OR x's `kind` EQUALS `eyeglasses or hearing aids, or prescriptions for them`)
            AND NOT x's `necessitated to correct a condition resulting solely from an external accidental Injury during the Period of Insurance`
        `without a Physician's recommendation, or a routine check-up` MEANS
                NOT x's `on the recommendation of a Physician`
            OR  `routine, not incidental to a covered Disability`
        `routine, not incidental to a covered Disability` MEANS
                x's `kind` EQUALS `a routine physical examination or health check-up`
            AND NOT x's `incidental to the treatment or diagnosis of a covered Disability`

-- 1A.2(i). The wording speaks only of the Insured Person who is unable to return; an expense
-- after the end of cover by one who could return is not provided for, and is refused.
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`1A does not say whether an expense after the end of cover is met when the Insured Person could return` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 1A does not say whether an expense incurred abroad after the end of cover is met when the Insured Person could return"

GIVEN c IS A `The case`
GIVETH A DATE
`the termination of the cover for 1A.2(i)` c MEANS
    IF   c's `certificate`'s `product` EQUALS `Annual Travel`
    THEN IF   tripEnd AT MOST lastDay
         THEN tripEnd
         ELSE lastDay
    ELSE lastDay
    WHERE
        lastDay MEANS c's `certificate`'s `last day of the Period of Insurance`
        tripEnd MEANS c's `trip`'s `date of departure from the Country of Origin` PLUS 89

GIVEN c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A Medical Expenses claim`
      x     IS A `A medical expense`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1A.2(i) — the expense arose more than 30 days after the end of cover` c claim x MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT x's `incurred outside the Country of Origin`
                THEN FALSE
           IF x's `date incurred` AT MOST `the termination of the cover for 1A.2(i)` c
                THEN FALSE
           IF claim's `the Insured Person is unable to return to the Country of Origin, or to the final destination`
                THEN x's `date incurred` GREATER THAN (`the termination of the cover for 1A.2(i)` c PLUS 30)
           OTHERWISE `1A does not say whether an expense after the end of cover is met when the Insured Person could return`

§§ `1A — the amount payable`

GIVEN v     IS A `Text version`
      c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A Medical Expenses claim`
      x     IS A `A medical expense`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1A — the amount payable for the expense` v c claim x MEANS
    IF       `1A.1(a) names the kind of expense` (x's `kind`)
         AND `1A.1 proviso — the expense meets the proviso` c x
         AND NOT `1A.2 — the expense is excluded` claim x
         AND NOT `1A.2(i) — the expense arose more than 30 days after the end of cover` c claim x
    THEN `1A.1(a) — the daily cap applied to` x `of` (`the eligible amount of` v x)
    ELSE 0

-- (b) caps the follow-up expenses after return at VND 130,000,000 in all; the Certificate's
-- Medical Expenses limit caps the whole (clause 11 calls it "the maximum coverage set out in
-- the Insurance Certificate").
GIVEN v     IS A `Text version`
      c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A Medical Expenses claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1A — the amount payable` v c claim MEANS
    IF   `the Disability is covered under section` v c `1A Medical Expenses` (claim's `the Disability`)
    THEN min (`abroad` PLUS min `after return` 130_000_000)
             (`the Certificate's limit` (c's `certificate`'s `limits`'s `Medical Expenses`) `for` "Medical Expenses")
    ELSE 0
    WHERE
        `payable` x MEANS `1A — the amount payable for the expense` v c claim x
        `after return` MEANS sum (map `payable` (filter (GIVEN x YIELD `1A.1(b) — the expense is a follow-up within 90 days of return` c x) (claim's `expenses`)))
        `abroad`       MEANS sum (map `payable` (filter (GIVEN x YIELD NOT `1A.1(b) — the expense is a follow-up within 90 days of return` c x) (claim's `expenses`)))

